{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ScreenEnd","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ScreenEnd\/init()"],"title":"Initializers"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScreenEnd"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This event is tracked automatically before each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenView"},{"type":"text","text":" event when screen engagement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking is enabled, closing out the engagement summary for the previous screen."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It can also be tracked manually to end the current screen without starting a new one –","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for instance when a WebView is presented over a native screen, or when a screen is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dismissed without a subsequent screen view being tracked. Tracking it manually stops the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"engagement timer for the current screen and attaches the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"screen_summary"},{"text":" entity.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After the screen ends, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"screen"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"screen_summary"},{"type":"text","text":" entities are no longer attached to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subsequent events until the next "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenView"},{"type":"text","text":". The next "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenView"},{"type":"text","text":" still references the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ended screen in its previous screen fields and no further "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenEnd"},{"type":"text","text":" is tracked for it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The event is not tracked if there is no current screen to end."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/screenend"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScreenEnd"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScreenEnd"}],"modules":[{"name":"SnowplowTracker"}],"roleHeading":"Class","externalID":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)ScreenEnd","symbolKind":"class","title":"ScreenEnd"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/SelfDescribingAbstract"],"title":"Inherits From"},{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/objc(pl)NSObject","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/s7CVarArgP","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/s28CustomDebugStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/SQ","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/SH"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Event tracked when a screen is no longer visible to the user."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowtracker","role":"collection","abstract":[],"title":"SnowplowTracker","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker","type":"topic"},"doc://SnowplowTracker/SQ":{"title":"